1
00:00:05,285 --> 00:00:09,718
Sharing a dashboard. A live, read-only link for anyone

2
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:16,353
Show the goals you want to share, and untick metrics to leave out. Then click Share.

3
00:00:16,468 --> 00:00:20,088
Give the link a name, and click Create link.

4
00:00:20,803 --> 00:00:23,019
Click Copy, and send it.

5
00:00:23,635 --> 00:00:29,821
Anyone with the link sees the charts, live, without signing in. No notes or names are shown.

6
00:00:29,966 --> 00:00:35,549
To end a link, open Share again, and click Revoke under Your links.
